blog/why-wikipedia-articles-get-deleted#article\",\"headline\":\"Why Wikipedia Articles Get Deleted\",\"description\":\"Understand common reasons Wikipedia articles are deleted or nominated for deletion, including weak sourcing, promotional tone, and notability concerns.\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/why-wikipedia-articles-get-deleted\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/why-wikipedia-articles-get-deleted#webpage\"},\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"MIQ LLC\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"MIQ LLC\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/favicon.svg\"}},\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-10\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-10\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\"},\"keywords\":[\"why Wikipedia articles get deleted\",\"Wikipedia deletion\",\"Wikipedia notability\",\"Wikipedia reliable sources\",\"Wikipedia article guidelines\"],\"hasPart\":{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can a deleted Wikipedia article be restored?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Sometimes content can be improved and resubmitted through an appropriate process, but restoration depends on the reason for deletion and whether reliable independent sources support the topic. There is no guarantee of restoration.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does paid editing cause deletion?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Paid editing alone is not the only issue, but undisclosed paid contributions, promotional writing, or weak sourcing can increase scrutiny and risk. Transparency and policy compliance are important.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How can I prevent deletion before publishing?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Start with a notability and source review, use independent reliable sources, write neutrally, and avoid unsupported claims. A policy-aware review can help identify risks before submission.\"}}]}}24:[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/why-wikipedia-articles-get-deleted#webpage\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Why Wikipedia Articles Get Deleted\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Understand common reasons Wikipedia articles are deleted or nominated for deletion, including weak sourcing, promotional tone, and notability concerns.\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/why-wikipedia-articles-get-deleted\\\",\\\"isPartOf\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#website\\\"},\\\"about\\\":{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/#organization\\\"},\\\"inLanguage\\\":\\\"en-US\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Home\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Insights\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Why Wikipedia Articles Get Deleted\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://miqllcwiki.com/blog/why-wikipedia-articles-get-deleted\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2e\"}}]],\"$L2f\",\"$L30\"]\n27:null\n2d:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Why Wikipedia Articles Get Deleted | MIQ LLC | MIQ LLC\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Understand common reasons Wikipedia articles are deleted or nominated for deletion, includ